(44,1,'2026-06-03 07:52:41','2026-06-03 07:52:41','Professional AI automation illustration showcasing how businesses leverage artificial intelligence, workflow automation, data analytics, AI agents, and intelligent business processes to improve efficiency, enhance customer experiences, and accelerate growth. Created for the HilDes article \"How AI Automation Is Transforming Modern Businesses.\"','AI Automation Driving Business Growth | HilDes','AI automation helps businesses streamline operations, improve productivity, reduce costs, and make smarter data-driven decisions.','inherit','open','closed','','hildes-ai-automation-driving-business-growth','','','2026-06-03 07:53:37','2026-06-03 07:53:37','',42,'https://www.hildes.io/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/hildes-ai-automation-driving-business-growth.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),
